# this is a tab separated file describing the location of funannotate databases used for the
# funannotate annotation tool
#
# the columns are:
# value	description	format_version	path
#
# for example
# funannotate-1.8.15-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef	Funannotate database funannotate-1.8.15-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef	1.0	/tmp/database/funannotate/funannotate-1.8.15-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
